  options: ["A. Bracketing only works within 5 NM of the station \u2014 distant NDB requires GPS", "B. ADF bracketing is only used when the wind is perpendicular to track \u2014 headwind/tailwind needs no correction", "C. NDB wind correction requires only maintaining the needle at 0\u00b0 relative bearing", "D. NDB bracketing/wind correction: (1) Establish desired track heading; (2) Check ADF \u2014 if needle drifts, apply heading correction to return needle to desired relative bearing; (3) Overshoot slightly; (4) Apply half the original correction as WCA; (5) Monitor and refine. This empirically determines the wind correction angle without a navigation computer"],
