  explanation: "Composite navigation redundancy: if GPS is the only source, GPS failure = lost navigation. With VOR, NDB, and visual cross-checks, any single failure is detectable. If GPS shows a position inconsistent with the VOR radial or visual landmark \u2014 an alert is generated. This redundancy is essential for safety.",
